# Go build artifacts
# bin/simple-harness-runtime is the COMMITTED runtime binary and is NOT
# ignored — it is the binary the wrapper execs. The paths below are for
# developer-machine / CI build outputs.
*.test
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html
/simple-harness
/simple-harness-runtime

# Environment, databases, backup and editor litter (added 2026-09-01;
# .claude/settings.local.json was previously only protected by a
# machine-local global ignore that does not travel with the repo)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.sqlite*
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
*~
*.swp
*.pid
.claude/settings.local.json
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
